    "answer": {
      "short": "$5(x+1)^2-3$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5x^2+10x+2&=5\\left(x^2+2x+\\frac25\\right)\\\\5x^2+10x+2&=5\\left((x+1)^2-1+\\frac25\\right)\\\\5x^2+10x+2&=5(x+1)^2-3.\\end{align*}$$",
